WEBVTT

00:00:03.206 --> 00:00:06.266
Workflows is under Design in the admin menu.

00:00:06.266 --> 00:00:08.470
The page lists your workflows.

00:00:08.470 --> 00:00:11.346
This site has none, so the list is empty.

00:00:11.833 --> 00:00:13.811
Let's select Create Workflow.

00:00:13.811 --> 00:00:17.541
It asks only for a name, and the name says what the workflow

00:00:17.541 --> 00:00:21.553
does, such as notifying the editors when an article is published.

00:00:22.045 --> 00:00:23.699
Let's open More settings.

00:00:23.699 --> 00:00:27.755
It holds options, such as whether the workflow is enabled and how many

00:00:27.755 --> 00:00:29.356
instances run at a time.

00:00:29.356 --> 00:00:32.825
The defaults suit most workflows, so they stay as they are.

00:00:33.296 --> 00:00:35.936
Let's select Create and open the designer.

00:00:35.936 --> 00:00:39.896
It saves the workflow and opens the designer with an empty canvas.

